From 0d2133d60e8e9755baa660fd6a49857ad816092d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Heiner Kallweit <hkallweit1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 15 May 2024 08:18:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 006/744] Revert "r8169: don't try to disable interrupts if
 NAPI is, scheduled already"

commit eabb8a9be1e4a12f3bf37ceb7411083e3775672d upstream.

This reverts commit 7274c4147afbf46f45b8501edbdad6da8cd013b9.

Ken reported that RTL8125b can lock up if gro_flush_timeout has the
default value of 20000 and napi_defer_hard_irqs is set to 0.
