drivers/net/ethernet/smsc/smc91x.c: In function ‘smc_reset’:
drivers/net/ethernet/smsc/smc91x.h:160:40: error: implicit declaration of function ‘_swapw’; did you mean ‘swap’? [-Werror=implicit-function-declaration]
