From 9495c98af42c70a662c7186aba8ed51053e3ecfe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aapo Vienamo <aapo.vienamo@linux.intel.com>
Date: Wed, 13 Mar 2024 19:34:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 125/744] mtd: core: Report error if first mtd_otp_size() call
 fails in mtd_otp_nvmem_add()

[ Upstream commit d44f0bbbd8d182debcce88bda55b05269f3d33d6 ]

