From b6284f843862d04f3db176f7f6be76f8e559eda1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tetsuo Handa <penguin-kernel@I-love.SAKURA.ne.jp>
Date: Sun, 5 May 2024 23:08:31 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 299/744] dma-buf/sw-sync: don't enable IRQ from
