From ec9d43198625c4505f2761c50d51952780f0d69b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kuniyuki Iwashima <kuniyu@amazon.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Jun 2024 09:52:35 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 418/744] af_unix: Annotate data-races around sk->sk_state in
