CR2: 00007f48f5253a08 CR3: 00000003cb82e000 CR4: 00000000003506f0
Call Trace:
 <TASK>
 ? kernfs_remove_by_name_ns+0xb9/0xc0
 ? __warn+0x7c/0x130
 ? kernfs_remove_by_name_ns+0xb9/0xc0
